                            {
                                "example_id": "fa23d273-b7a0-4ff9-b1ab-ba5af6ca27f4",
                                "sense_id": "d431d328-09bf-3f64-8da9-d06eee6281d2",
                                "text": "Полы́ бы́ли вы́крашены, натё́рты во́ском и у́стланы клеё́нками; пе́чи обло́жены пё́стрыми, стари́нными, то́же взя́тыми из большо́го до́ма, изразца́ми.",
                                "translation": "The floors were painted, waxed, and covered with linoleum. The stoves were decorated with brilliantly coloured/colored antique tiles also brought in from the big house.",
                                "english": "The floors were painted, waxed, and covered with linoleum. The stoves were decorated with brilliantly coloured/colored antique tiles also brought in from the big house."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
